(7720607, 1270396, 114285, '<td valign="top">You know what Mark I think you should smile more, you always come across so serious but Im sure you are a very chirpy guy. Unless of course you dont have much to smile about. Just saying. Please dont get offended with this comment. I do really hope to see more lively photos from yourself, show us your teeth :)<br/> <br/>Having said that this image does suit the resolute look youve gone for.  Its tremendously done. Especially the speckled mirror.  Im sure that it will ribbon, I hope my vote helps.</td>', 'You know what Mark I think you should smile more, you always come across so serious but Im sure you are a very chirpy guy. Unless of course you dont have much to smile about. Just saying. Please dont get offended with this comment. I do really hope to see more lively photos from yourself, show us your teeth :) Having said that this image does suit the resolute look youve gone for.  Its tremendously done. Especially the speckled mirror.  Im sure that it will ribbon, I hope my vote helps.', '2022-05-23 00:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
